},{"text":"생길","x":359,"y":1120,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":422,"y":1121,"width":27,"height":29},{"text":"있다.","x":463,"y":1120,"width":55,"height":30}]},{"text":"4. 반정규화와 성능","words":[{"text":"4.","x":200,"y":1282,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"반정규화와","x":253,"y":1277,"width":186,"height":43},{"text":"성능","x":454,"y":1278,"width":74,"height":41}]},{"text":"반정규화는 정규화를 반대로 하는 것으로 역정규화라고도 한다. 정규와는 데이터의 중복을 최소화했다면, 반정규","words":[{"text":"반정규화는","x":233,"y":1378,"width":126,"height":30},{"text":"정규화를","x":369,"y":1378,"width":99,"height":31},{"text":"반대로","x":477,"y":1378,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"하는","x":560,"y":1377,"width":48,"height":30},{"text":"것으로","x":619,"y":1378,"width":73,"height":29},{"text":"역정규화라고도","x":702,"y":1376,"width":174,"height":32},{"text":"한다.","x":885,"y":1376,"width":56,"height":30},{"text":"정규와는","x":954,"y":1376,"width":102,"height":30},{"text":"데이터의","x":1066,"y":1376,"width":99,"height":30},{"text":"중복을","x":1177,"y":1376,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"최소화했다면,","x":1264,"y":1375,"width":162,"height":33},{"text":"반정규","x":1439,"y":1374,"width":77,"height":31}]},{"text":"화는 성능을 위해 데이터 중복을 허용하는 것이다. 그러므로 성능이 문제될 때 주로 반정규화에 대해 논의하게","words":[{"text":"화는","x":200,"y":1426,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"성능을","x":265,"y":1426,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"위해","x":354,"y":1426,"width":48,"height":30},{"text":"데이터","x":416,"y":1426,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"중복을","x":504,"y":1425,"width":74,"height":31},{"text":"허용하는","x":590,"y":1425,"width":100,"height":30},{"text":"것이다.","x":704,"y":1424,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"그러므로","x":799,"y":1424,"width":102,"height":30},{"text":"성능이","x":914,"y":1423,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"문제될","x":1004,"y":1424,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"때","x":1096,"y":1424,"width":25,"height":30},{"text":"주로","x":1135,"y":1426,"width":53,"height":27},{"text":"반정규화에","x":1200,"y":1423,"width":128,"height":31},{"text":"대해","x":1344,"y":1423,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"논의하게","x":1408,"y":1422,"width":106,"height":31}]},{"text":"된다.","words":[{"text":"된다.","x":201,"y":1474,"width":58,"height":30}]},{"text":"하지만 반정규화가 항상 성능을 향상시킬까? 조-회성능을 향상시길 수 있을지 모르겠으나 그로인한 입력수정작제","words":[{"text":"하지만","x":233,"y":1521,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"반정규화가","x":318,"y":1521,"width":122,"height":30},{"text":"항상","x":448,"y":1521,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"성능을","x":508,"y":1520,"width":73,"height":31},{"text":"향상시킬까?","x":590,"y":1521,"width":131,"height":31},{"text":"조-회성능을","x":731,"y":1521,"width":125,"height":31},{"text":"향상시길","x":865,"y":1520,"width":100,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":975,"y":1521,"width":27,"height":30},{"text":"있을지","x":1012,"y":1520,"width":74,"height":31},{"text":"모르겠으나","x":1098,"y":1519,"width":128,"height":31},{"text":"그로인한","x":1233,"y":1519,"width":103,"height":31},{"text":"입력수정작제","x":1346,"y":1520,"width":168,"height":32}]},{"text":"성능은 저하일 수 있다. 이 부분을 염두에 두고 반정규화해야 할 것이다.","words":[{"text":"성능은","x":201,"y":1568,"width":77,"height":31},{"text":"저하일","x":291,"y":1568,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":379,"y":1569,"width":26,"height":30},{"text":"있다.","x":417,"y":1569,"width":57,"height":30},{"text":"이","x":490,"y":1568,"width":22,"height":31},{"text":"부분을","x":526,"y":1569,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"염두에","x":616,"y":1569,"width":74,"height":31},{"text":"두고","x":704,"y":1572,"width":52,"height":28},{"text":"반정규화해야","x":769,"y":1569,"width":154,"height":31},{"text":"할","x":934,"y":1569,"width":28,"height":31},{"text":"것이다.","x":976,"y":1569,"width":83,"height":31}]},{"text":"다음은 사례를 들어 정규화와 반정규화가 성능에 미치는 영향을 살펴본다.","words":[{"text":"다음은","x":234,"y":1616,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"사례를","x":323,"y":1616,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"들어","x":409,"y":1617,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"정규화와","x":476,"y":1616,"width":100,"height":31},{"text":"반정규화가","x":588,"y":1617,"width":128,"height":31},{"text":"성능에","x":728,"y":1618,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"미치는","x":817,"y":1618,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"영향을","x":907,"y":1618,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"살펴본다.","x":998,"y":1617,"width":111,"height":30}]},{"text":"가. 반정규화를 적용한 모텔에서 성능이 향상될 수 있는 경우","words":[{"text":"가.","x":199,"y":1711,"width":34,"height":32},{"text":"반정규화를","x":249,"y":1712,"width":128,"height":32},{"text":"적용한","x":389,"y":1713,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"모텔에서","x":480,"y":1713,"width":101,"height":32},{"text":"성능이","x":595,"y":1714,"width":76,"height":31},{"text":"향상될","x":686,"y":1714,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":775,"y":1715,"width":27,"height":30},{"text":"있는","x":815,"y":1713,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"경우","x":880,"y":1714,"width":54,"height":31}]},{"text":"[그림 1-2-9]는 주문과 결제에 대한 모델이다. 본 모델에서 생소한 속성만 설명하면, 주문 엔터티에서 주문상태","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":231,"y":1780,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"1-2-9]는","x":308,"y":1782,"width":94,"height":30},{"text":"주문과","x":411,"y":1781,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"결제에","x":500,"y":1780,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"대한","x":585,"y":1781,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"모델이다.","x":643,"y":1781,"width":106,"height":29},{"text":"본","x":760,"y":1782,"width":27,"height":28},{"text":"모델에서","x":796,"y":1780,"width":100,"height":29},{"text":"생소한","x":909,"y":1779,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"속성만","x":995,"y":1780,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"설명하면,","x":1086,"y":1781,"width":108,"height":33},{"text":"주문","x":1206,"y":1783,"width":53,"height":27},{"text":"엔터티에서","x":1269,"y":1781,"width":127,"height":31},{"text":"주문상태","x":1409,"y":1781,"width":104,"height":30}]},{"text":"코드는 주문 상대에 대한 코드값으로 \u0027주똲취소반품고홴 등의 정보를 관리하고, 결제일시 수성은 실제 결제를","words":[{"text":"코드는","x":197,"y":1829,"width":79,"height":27},{"text":"주문","x":287,"y":1829,"width":51,"height":28},{"text":"상대에","x":349,"y":1827,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"대한","x":437,"y":1827,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"코드값으로","x":497,"y":1827,"width":127,"height":30},{"text":"\u0027주똲취소반품고홴","x":634,"y":1827,"width":240,"height":30},{"text":"등의","x":886,"y":1826,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"정보를","x":950,"y":1826,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"관리하고,","x":1039,"y":1829,"width":111,"height":32},{"text":"결제일시","x":1165,"y":1827,"width":101,"height":31},{"text":"수성은","x":1280,"y":1829,"width":78,"height":29},{"text":"실제","x":1371,"y":1828,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"결제를","x":1436,"y":1828,"width":79,"height":30}]},{"text":"진행한 일시정보를 관리한다. 결제 엔터티에서 결제수단구분코드 속성은 \u0027카드결제•계좌이체쇈드폰결碍 등을 관리","words":[{"text":"진행한","x":198,"y":1875,"width":77,"height":31},{"text":"일시정보를","x":284,"y":1875,"width":124,"height":31},{"text":"관리한다.","x":417,"y":1875,"width":106,"height":30},{"text":"결제","x":536,"y":1875,"width":48,"height":29},{"text":"엔터티에서","x":596,"y":1874,"width":121,"height":31},{"text":"결제수단구분코드","x":731,"y":1874,"width":200,"height":31},{"text":"속성은","x":940,"y":1873,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"\u0027카드결제•계좌이체쇈드폰결碍","x":1028,"y":1875,"width":362,"height":31},{"text":"등을","x":1400,"y":1877,"width":54,"height":29},{"text":"관리","x":1464,"y":1875,"width":51,"height":29}]},{"text":"하는 코드값이다 결제수단번호 속성은 결제수단구분코드에서 사용한 실제 \u0027카드번호•계좌번호•엔드폰번호\u0027 등을","words":[{"text":"하는","x":197,"y":1922,"width":52,"height":29},{"text":"코드값이다","x":260,"y":1923,"width":134,"height":29},{"text":"결제수단번호","x":408,"y":1922,"width":151,"height":31},{"text":"속성은","x":570,"y":1922,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"결제수단구분코드에서","x":659,"y":1922,"width":252,"height":31},{"text":"사용한","x":924,"y":1923,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"실제","x":1016,"y":1923,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"\u0027카드번호•계좌번호•엔드폰번호\u0027","x":1079,"y":1922,"width":370,"height":31},{"text":"등을","x":1463,"y":1923,"width":52,"height":30}]},{"text":"관리하는 속성값이다.","words":[{"text":"관리하는","x":198,"y":1969,"width":103,"height":31},{"text":"속성값이다.","x":313,"y":1969,"width":133,"height":31}]},{"text":"전문가 7h1드 91","words":[{"text":"전문가","x":1316,"y":2094,"width":57,"height":27},{"text":"7h1드","x":1382,"y":2095,"width":57,"height":25},{"text":"91","x":1465,"y":2094,"width":35,"height":28}]}